Karajan Gandhara

Karajan Gandhara utawa Gandhara iku karajan kang dumunung ana ing tlatah &lt;a href="India%20Kulon"&gt;India Kulon&lt;/a&gt;. Karajan mau ana amarga &lt;a href="carita"&gt;carita&lt;/a&gt; epik &lt;a href="Mahabharata"&gt;Mahabharata&lt;/a&gt; uga &lt;a href="Ramayana"&gt;Ramayana&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Raja%20Gandhara"&gt;Raja Gandhara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sengkuni"&gt;Sengkuni&lt;/a&gt;,dadi tokoh ing partentangan/parmusuhan antarané &lt;a href="Duryodana"&gt;Duryodana&lt;/a&gt; uga para &lt;a href="Pandawa"&gt;Pandawa&lt;/a&gt;, kang njalari mledosé &lt;a href="perang%20ing%20Kurukshetra"&gt;perang ing Kurukshetra&lt;/a&gt;. Sajeroning &lt;a href="Mahabharata"&gt;Mahabharata&lt;/a&gt;, karajan iki tumut perang ing Kurkshetra lan dadi mbela Duryodana. Sadulur sakandung ya iku adine Sengkuni dadi garwané &lt;a href="Dretarastra"&gt;Dretarastra&lt;/a&gt;, kang misuwur kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Gandari"&gt;Gandari&lt;/a&gt;. Karajan Gandhara (Gandhara Kulon) dumunung nana ing &lt;a href="provinsi"&gt;provinsi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kandahar"&gt;Kandahar&lt;/a&gt; talatah &lt;a href="Afganistan"&gt;Afganistan&lt;/a&gt;. Gandhara Wétan dumunung ing tlatah &lt;a href="Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Puskalawati"&gt;Puskalawati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Takshasila"&gt;Takshasila&lt;/a&gt; (Taxila) uga &lt;a href="Purushapura"&gt;Purushapura&lt;/a&gt; (Peshawar) didadèkaké salah sijiné &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; ing Karajan Gandhara. Takshasila madeg déning adik &lt;a href="Rama"&gt;Rama Ragawa&lt;/a&gt; — &lt;a href="Barata"&gt;Barata&lt;/a&gt;. Banjur katurunan Barata bisa mimpin karajan mau. Salakuné jaman Mahabharata, Gandhara kapimpin déning &lt;a href="Subala"&gt;Subala&lt;/a&gt; (bapa saka Sangkuni), &lt;a href="Sangkuni"&gt;Sangkuni&lt;/a&gt;, uga putra saka Sangkuni. &lt;a href="Arjuna"&gt;Arjuna&lt;/a&gt; bisa ngalahake putra Sangkuni sajeroning nglakoni misi siar kanggo upacara &lt;a href="Aswamedha"&gt;Aswamedha&lt;/a&gt; Raja &lt;a href="Yudistira"&gt;Yudistira&lt;/a&gt;.

