Kreteg Qingdao Haiwan (utawa Kreteg Teluk Jiaozhou) ya iku wangun &lt;a href="kreteg"&gt;kreteg&lt;/a&gt; kang dumunung ana ing &lt;a href="provinsi"&gt;provinsi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Shandong"&gt;Shandong&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Republik%20Rakyat%20Cina"&gt;Republik Rakyat Cina&lt;/a&gt;. Kreteg punika ngubungake minangka &lt;a href="Distrik%20Hongdao"&gt;Distrik Hongdao&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Qingdao"&gt;Qingdao&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="pulo%20Hongdao"&gt;pulo Hongdao&lt;/a&gt; uga ngelewati &lt;a href="teluk%20Jiaozhou"&gt;teluk Jiaozhou&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="http%3A//www.chinadaily.com.cn/china/images/attachement/jpg/site1/20110701/002170196e1c0f774f4b0a.jpg"&gt;lihat peta&lt;/a&gt;). Kreteg punika uga duwé dawa kurang luwih 42,5&amp;nbsp;km, saéngga bisa njerakake jarak saka Qingdao déning Huangdao kurang luwih 31&amp;nbsp;km. Kreteg Qingdao uga dadi salah sijiné kreteg kang kalebu &lt;a href="prat%C3%A9lan%20kreteg%20paling%20dawa%20ing%20donya"&gt;Kreteg paling dawa ing donya kang ana ing saduwuré banyu&lt;/a&gt; versi &lt;a href="Guinness%20World%20Records"&gt;Guinness World Records&lt;/a&gt; lan bisa nggeserake &lt;a href="Kreteg%20Tlaga%20Ponchartrain"&gt;Kreteg Tlaga Ponchartrain&lt;/a&gt; minangka sawisé pambuka kreteg ing tanggal &lt;a href="30%20Juni"&gt;30 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;.
