Beatrix von Brandenburg (#ALIH; 1270 – 26 April 1316), panjenengané iku putri &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; lan dadi kulawarga &lt;a href="wangsa%20Askanier"&gt;wangsa Askanier&lt;/a&gt; saking cabang &lt;a href="Brandenburg"&gt;Brandenburg&lt;/a&gt;. Sajeroning nglakoni temantenan panjenengané kagolong dadi &lt;a href="adipati"&gt;adipati&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%C5%9Awidnica"&gt;Świdnica&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ko%C5%BAle"&gt;Koźle&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Bytom"&gt;Bytom&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Siewierz"&gt;Siewierz&lt;/a&gt;.Panjenengané ya iku putri saka &lt;a href="Otto%20V%20si%20Jangkung"&gt;Otto V si Jangkung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Markgraf%20Brandenburg"&gt;Markgraf Brandenburg&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Salzwedel"&gt;Salzwedel&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi bebojoan Judit kaliyan Henneberg, putri adipati &lt;a href="Hermann%20I%20dari%20Henneberg"&gt;Hermann I dari Henneberg&lt;/a&gt; uga pewaris &lt;a href="Coburg"&gt;Coburg&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Schmalkalden"&gt;Schmalkalden&lt;/a&gt;.
