<doc id="83812" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=83812" title="Yakub Kolas">
Yakub Kolas

Yakub Kolas (utawi Jakub Kolas) (&lt;a href="basa%20B%C3%A9larus"&gt;Bélarus&lt;/a&gt;: Якуб Колас, &lt;a href="November%203"&gt;November 3&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1882"&gt;1882&lt;/a&gt; - 13 Agustus 1956), punika piyantun ingkang gadhah asma asli Kanstantsin Mitskievich (Міцкевіч Канстанцін Міхайлавіч) panjenenganipun &lt;a href="B%C3%A9larus"&gt;Bélarus&lt;/a&gt; ugi panyerat, Panyair Rakyat &lt;a href="B%C3%A9larus%20RSK"&gt;Bélarus RSK&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1926"&gt;1926&lt;/a&gt;), ing &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; (1928).Ugi dados wakil &lt;a href="pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n"&gt;présidhèn&lt;/a&gt; (taun 1929) saking &lt;a href="B%C3%A9larusia%20Academy%20of%20Sciences"&gt;Bélarusia Academy of Sciences&lt;/a&gt;.
Sajeroning ngasilaké karya-karyanipun, Kolas Yakub misuwur amarga mamparjuangake para sederek tani utun Bélarusia. Babaganpunika kabukti sajeroning seratan &lt;a href="pena"&gt;pena&lt;/a&gt; 'Kolas', kanthi irah-irahan 'kuping gabah' kang saged dipunartikake sajeroning Bélarusia. Panjenenganipun ugi misuwur kanthi panyerat puisi koleksi iSongs of Captivity

